SD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126.016.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第16スライド","duration":8.386507936507936},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_017_ナレーション.wav","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","characterName":"ナレーション","transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice__93E3","animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 17","voiceDuration":8.243038548752834,"id":"43FF892F-D46D-497F-8CD1-4F228DE35D60","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"だが、弁当を食べ切ると同時に、全身に衝撃が走り、そのまま教室を抜け出し、ある場所…多目的トイレを探す。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126.017.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第17スライド","duration":8.843038548752833},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_018_ナレーション.wav","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","characterName":"ナレーション","transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice__93E3","animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 18","voiceDuration":3.6930385487528343,"seName":"SE: 倒れる","id":"604E397F-7BC5-44A8-976A-0549AAE7DE10","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"そして私は、多目的トイレに来るとその場に倒れ込んだ。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126.018.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第18スライド","duration":4.293038548752834,"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/倒れる.mp3"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_019_操夢.wav","voiceCharacter":"操夢","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 19","voiceDuration":8.699546485260772,"id":"38B048D0-6443-4C28-B1E2-CF293C90D04C","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「ん…、ここは…トイレ…」僕はそう呟き、ハッと思い出す。\n「確か、10分の自己紹介で人生を話したら、気絶して…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126.019.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第19スライド","duration":9.299546485260771},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_020_操夢.wav","voiceCharacter":"操夢","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 20","voiceDuration":6.53,"id":"2FC26156-E82C-4F19-9E32-C1D835B2451E","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「とりあえず…教室に戻るか…」\n僕はそう一人呟くと、念入りに手を洗ってから、トイレを出た。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126.020.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第20スライド","duration":7.13},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_021_古明地さとり.wav","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","characterName":"古明地さとり","transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 21","voiceDuration":5.225646258503401,"id":"96BB2646-EEF9-4F1D-AD23-AEEE42880F3C","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"僕が教室に戻ってくると、\nさとりと呼ばれていた少女が僕に、駆け寄ってくる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa209