苗","transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 42","voiceDuration":2.77702947845805,"id":"4558425A-EEC8-4ABA-8B81-C105A1712FB0","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「何か、伝えたいことがある生徒はいますか。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126.042.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第42スライド","duration":3.5},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_操夢.wav","voiceCharacter":"操夢","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 43","voiceDuration":3.195215419501134,"id":"9CC86DDC-EA30-4AB4-8948-59660E37A6A9","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"彼女がそういうと、シーンと教室が静まり返る。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126.043.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第43スライド","duration":3.795215419501134},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_東風谷早苗.wav","voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","characterName":"東風谷早苗","transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 44","voiceDuration":3.8336054421768706,"id":"2C50918F-296A-4C88-88A0-116049F442CB","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「それでは、終礼はこれで終了です。お疲れ様でした。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126\/元女子校の日常　第2話_aaa2097126.044.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repo